                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Royal 15 B.xix fols. 200–205, is probably a
                        detached fragment of Salisbury Cath. 115, which once contained, according to
                        medieval tables, Enigmata scimproici (sic), Enigmata bonefacii. The riddles
